{"id":"662166","name":"南瓜豆腐肉沫汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662166/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜洗净去皮切薄片。","img":"images/662166/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"肉沫提前绞碎备用。","img":"images/662166/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆腐切小块备用。","img":"images/662166/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫。","img":"images/662166/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒散开变色。","img":"images/662166/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入南瓜。","img":"images/662166/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/662166/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662166/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将南瓜转入珐琅锅中。","img":"images/662166/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上煮开转小火煲20分钟左右。","img":"images/662166/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分钟后的南瓜汤色比较白。","img":"images/662166/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入豆腐。","img":"images/662166/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大火煮开煲多十分钟左右，出锅前少许盐调味。","img":"images/662166/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662166/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662166/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}